Gettext: the gettext API of native language support, with libintl of
the package az.

The module gettext of PHP 8.3 for php83 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20230831/gettext.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php83/conf.d, its
headers in include/php83/php/ext/gettext.
